All,

It is confirmed that Clow has "signed" a deal with CMF to sell their PE end=
ed Gate Valve into the irrigation market.  Clow will not pursue an active p=
resence in the irrigation market.  By that it is meant they will not be ded=
icating sales and promotion effort in the irrigation market except on a cas=
ual basis.

Please monitor and advise of spec changes by Erik Christiansen, Sean Hyduk,=
 Dave Ragan, Mike Pignoto and others.

John

On a related note, John Silwonuk, National Sales Manager of Nibco, indicate=
d that Nibco will resume an active sales and promotion effort in the irriga=
tion market.

--_000_4414AEBBCFB2B648B49E5766D309768E98037C9D14MAIL_
